e":"Fukuzumi","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j1W4aiBUCbv6zbm3ERz8wq7sjdv.jpg"},{"id":96559,"name":"Kazuya Takahashi","role":"Masaya","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8iMidsLPqaVcW9u8J8xeCjYURu0.jpg"},{"id":1858989,"name":"Ryoko Tateishi","role":"Nagaoka","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b3AXX7yNH8rMdw3Ja96bRMzQgAK.jpg"},{"id":1404981,"name":"Daisuke Kuroda","role":"Ando","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bBwirsQ3ZvH1hNeNXXJGrpm3Ocu.jpg"},{"id":1875746,"name":"Miki Matsumoto","role":"Futamura's Wife","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dxaK1SMzehgrvnfyTHCIuDfRjBD.jpg"},{"id":2483717,"name":"Michie Ikeda","role":"Teshirogi"},{"id":1633616,"name":"Akemi Higashiyama","role":"Mori"},{"id":2367550,"name":"Yôko Imamoto","role":"Ichimura","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/diJynGKXnsBFv6kavQQ1qgc46jF.jpg"},{"id":2790780,"name":"Yuko Fukui","role":"Noguchi","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/slCOCQVPicaQtOXfsR3RFVGHh2.jpg"},{"id":1616696,"name":"Hisaya Ishigura"},{"id":1435905,"name":"Akoya Shinno"},{"id":2276897,"name":"Mana Minamihisamatsu"},{"id":2804511,"name":"Kazuya Yamazaki"},{"id":2748195,"name":"Takanori Kamachi","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zauRPxVzytyR3ANBtekW0ibExoO.jpg"},{"id":2078183,"name":"Kohei Ikeue","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hZL1Pd8bt2GOQfJ98P7ZVkz8HUL.jpg"},{"id":1161173,"name":"Kensuke Ashihara","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qoXEO17Zt0MRLfGBKZpxRKzoCQb.jpg"},{"id":2804512,"name":"Yoko Tobe","role":"TV Announcer"},{"id":2822658,"name":"Makoto Nakamura","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ignUWvg2id3mpQjGllwN3NJa8PO.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Ritratto di famiglia con tempesta","overview":"Un ex scrittore vive sugli allori dei riconoscimenti passati, sperperando i soldi che guadagna come detective privato in scommesse e alcol. Dopo la morte del padre, l'uomo è costretto a stringere nuovamente contatti con la madre, l'ex moglie e il figlio, e lentamente troverà il modo di rimettere in carreggiata sé stesso e la sua vita."},{"language":"en-US","title":"After the Storm","overview":"Ryota is an unpopular writer although he won a literary award 15 years ago. Now, Ryota works as a private detective. He is divorced from his ex-wife Kyoko and he has an 11-year-old son Shingo. His mother Yoshiko lives alone at her apartment. One day, Ryota, his ex-wife Kyoko, and son Shingo gather at Yoshiko's apartment. A typhoon passes and the family must stay there all night long."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"「海街diary」「そして父になる」の是枝裕和監督が、「歩いても　歩いても」「奇跡」に続いて阿部寛と3度目のタッグを組み、大人になりきれない男と年老いた母を中心に、夢見ていた未来とは違う現在を生きる家族の姿をつづった人間ドラマ。15年前に文学賞を一度受賞したものの、その後は売れず、作家として成功する夢を追い続けている中年男性・良多。現在は生活費のため探偵事務所で働いているが、周囲にも自分にも「小説のための取材」だと言い訳していた。別れた妻・響子への未練を引きずっている良多は、彼女を「張り込み」して新しい恋人がいることを知りショックを受ける。ある日、団地で一人暮らしをしている母・淑子の家に集まった良多と響子と11歳の息子・真悟は、台風で帰れなくなり、ひと晩を共に過ごすことになる。主人公の母親役を樹木希林が好演し、共演にも真木よう子、小林聡美、リリー・フランキーら豪華な顔ぶれがそろう。","tagline":"夢見た未来とちがう今を生きる、元家族の物語"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1h6lAdzSfxCoMiavILtbohzDEj7.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6v9G4Sc5ciRUoJ2wkutX3JBQj9K.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":374671,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1h6lAdzSfxCoMiavILtbohzDEj7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1h6lAdzSfxCoMiavILtbohzDEj7.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1h6lAdzSfxCoMiavILtbohzDEj7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1h6lAdzSfxCoMiavILtbohzDEj7.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","ur